        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellwood_City%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ellwood City sits along Connoquenessing Creek near its confluence with the Beaver River.",
